search and lock confirmation (tool).\n  3. Caller identity verification (tool).\n  4. Temporary password generation (tool).\n  6. Ticket resolution (tool).\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 7 (Conditional Branch Mapping & `execute_if`)**\n- **Step 3**: `execute_if: variables.user_locked == 'true'`.\n- **Step 4**: `execute_if: variables.identity_verified == 'true'`.\n- **Step 6**: `execute_if: variables.temp_password_generated == 'true'`.\n\n---\n\n#### **Stage 8 (Dynamic Timeout Allocation by Action Scope)**\n- **Step 1**: 30s (quick review).\n- **Step 2**: 30s (API call).\n- **Step 3**: 30s (API call).\n- **Step 4**: 30s (API call).\n- **Step 6**: 30s (API call).\n\n---\n\n### **Final OKF Playbook JSON Schema**\n```json\n{\n    \"reasoning_chain\": [\n        \"[Stage 1 Verification Gates]: Gate 1 (Function match) -> Gate 2 (Provider active) -> Gate 3 (Problem aligned) -> Gate 4 (Params complete) -> Result: tool_call | command for each step.\",\n        \"[Stage 2 Sequencing]: Ordered search/diagnostic steps before remediation (Steps 1-3 before 4-6).\",\n        \"[Stage 3 Variables]: Formatted {{entities.var}} and {{variables.var}} placeholders for dynamic inputs.\",\n        \"[Stage 4 Fallbacks]: No unwritten actions added. Step 5 omitted as per mandate.\",\n        \"[Stage 5 Verification]: Added output parse instructions for status flags and expected outputs.\",\n        \"[Stage 6 Recall]: Preserved 100% of diagnostic steps from the SOP.\",\n        \"[Stage 7 Branching]: Mapped execute_if conditions for Steps 3, 4, and 6.\",\n        \"[Stage 8 Timeouts]: Assigned timeout_seconds (30s for API calls).\"\n    ],\n    \"sop_id\": \"SOP-SOL-PWD-RESET-L1-002\",\n    \"title\": \"Reset a Locked-Out User's Password via CoreID Admin Console\",\n    \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n    \"category\": \"logins\",\n    \"target_os\": \"windows\",\n    \"description\": \"This playbook automates the process of resetting a locked-out user's password in the CoreID Admin Console. It includ