hes the action, provider is active, problem is aligned, and 'employee_id' is available. This step confirms the user's lock status.\",\n            \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n            \"provider\": \"solandra\",\n            \"function_name\": \"search_user\",\n            \"comm_inputs\": {\n                \"employee_id\": \"{{entities.employee_id}}\"\n            },\n            \"command\": null,\n            \"shell\": null,\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"Locked\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 30,\n            \"output_variable\": \"user_search_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"Inspect the 'status' field in the response. If 'status' is 'Locked', set 'user_locked' to 'true' and store 'user_id' in variables.user_id.\",\n            \"execute_if\": null,\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 3,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Verify the caller's identity using the CoreID identity verification checklist.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"tool_call\",\n            \"step_reasoning\": \"Gate 1-4 PASSED: 'verify_caller_identity' function matches the action, provider is active, problem is aligned, and required inputs are available or inferred. This step verifies the caller's identity before proceeding.\",\n            \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n            \"provider\": \"solandra\",\n            \"function_name\": \"verify_caller_identity\",\n            \"comm_inputs\": {\n                \"user_id\": \"{{variables.user_id}}\",\n                \"employee_id\": \"{{entities.employee_id}}\",\n                \"manager_name\": \"{{entities.manager_name}}\",\n                \"department\": \"{{entities.department}}\",\n                \"phone_last4\": \"null\"\n            },\n            \"command\": null,\n            \"shell\": null,\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"verified: true\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 30,\n            \"output_variable\": \"identity_verification_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"Inspect the 'verified' field in the response. If 'verified' is 'true', set 'identity_verified' to 'true'.\",\n            \"execute_if\": \"variables.user_locked == 'true'\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 4,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Generate a temporary password for the user and enable force change at next sign-in.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"tool_call\",\n            \"step_reasoning\": \"Gate 1-4 PASSED: 'generate_temporary_password' function matches the action, provider is active, problem is aligned, and 'user_id' is available from prior steps. This step generates a temporary password.\",\n            \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n            \"provider\": \"solandra\",\n            \"function_name\": \"generate_temporary_password\",\n            \"comm_inputs\": {\n                \"user_id\": \"{{variables.user_id}}\"\n            },\n            \"command\": null,\n            \"shell\": null,\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"temporary_password\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 30,\n            \"output_variable\": \"temp_password_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"Inspect the 'temporary_password' field in the response. Store the password in 'variables.temporary_password' and set 'temp_password_generated' to 'true'.\",\n            \"execute_if\": \"variables.identity_verified == 'true'\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 5,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Resolve the ticket with an audit note.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"tool_call\",\n            \"step_reasoning\": \"Gate 1-4 PASSED: 'resolve_ticket' function matches the action, provider is active, problem is aligned, and required inputs are available. This step logs the resolution note and closes the ticket.\",\n            \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n            \"provider\": \"solandra\",\n            \"function_name\": \"resolve_ticket\",\n            \"comm_inputs\": {\n                \"ticket_id\": \"{{entities.ticket_id}}\",\n                \"resolution_note\": \"Identity verified (2 of 4 checks), temporary password issued via CoreID, force-change-at-next-sign-in enabled. No OTP sent - admin-mediated reset per policy.\"\n            },\n            \"command\": null,\n            \"shell\": null,\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"Resolved\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 30,\n            \"output_variable\": \"ticket_resolution_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"Inspect the 'status' field in the response. If 'status' is 'Resolved', set 'ticket_resolved' to 'true'.\",\n            \"execute_if\": \"variables.temp_password_generated == 'true'\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```",
